#!author = ddgksf2013, 可莉🅥[https://github.com/luestr/ProxyResource/blob/main/README.md]

^https?:\/\/marki\.markiapp\.com\/mkg\/Advertising url reject-200

# ↓ 来自 kelee:marki_remove_ads.lpx「马克水印相机去广告」
